{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let's Play and Party with Lappy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lappy, the beloved character from TBS TV\u2019s <i>Love it!</i>, is now starring in a brand-new game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>LAPPY GAMES</i> is a fun-filled party action game where you compete to collect the most hearts with Lappy and friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 players at once, with full support for online multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the various stage events to your advantage\u2014whoever collects the most hearts wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade collected hearts for items in the gacha, and build up your collection in the in-game encyclopedia\u2014perfect for completionists!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple and easy-to-learn rules, it's a game everyone can enjoy. Gather your friends and family and get the party started!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273300?t=1757323282","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273300/7077b7cb542720a51ee2478eaeba33519c5ac771/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757323282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273300/ad2332373a90ffa347fcae7280dc01cd262a8ba4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757323282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273300/ad2332373a90ffa347fcae7280dc01cd262a8ba4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757323282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{